  unitName: Emerald Knight Hisui
  unitId: 30816
  unitNumber: 1419
  description: A demon who trained under the renowned "War Demon" of Ishgria. At
    his master's request, Hisui and his younger and brash training partner set off
    on a journey across the land as part of their tutelage, until his chronic illness
    took a turn for the worse. Knowing he wasn't much longer for this world, he challenged
    his partner to battle in order to pass his knowledge onto him. This would eventually
    result in Hisui's own defeat at the hands of his younger opponent, but he is
    rumored to have perished with an expression of satisfaction upon his face.
  summonDesc: Did you summon me here?<br>Then I shall fight for you.<br>Until my
    very last breath...
  fusionDesc: To think this technique existed!<br>Using it may just help my body
    last a bit longer...
